{"seq":1,"slug":"biofuels-biochemicals","title":"生物燃料与化学品","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biofuels-biochemicals","wordCount":1559,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"生物燃料与化学品\">生物燃料与化学品</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>全球化工产业每年消耗约4.5亿吨石油作为化工原料，贡献了约7%的碳排放。生物制造为大宗化学品与燃料提供了一条&quot;碳中性&quot;甚至&quot;负碳&quot;的替代路线——以可再生生物质或CO₂为碳源，通过微生物发酵或酶催化生产目标分子。</p>\n<h3 id=\"纤维素乙醇\">纤维素乙醇</h3><p><strong>技术路线</strong>：木质纤维素（秸秆、木片）→ 预处理 → 酶水解 → 发酵 → 蒸馏</p>\n<p>第二代生物乙醇的核心挑战在于木质纤维素的抗降解屏障：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>预处理</strong>：蒸汽爆破、稀酸处理或离子液体溶解——破坏木质素-纤维素-半纤维素的致密结构</li>\n<li><strong>酶水解</strong>：纤维素酶复合物（内切酶+外切酶+β-葡萄糖苷酶）将纤维素降解为可发酵糖。当前酶成本已降至~$0.05/加仑乙醇</li>\n<li><strong>共发酵</strong>：工程化酿酒酵母或运动发酵单胞菌同时利用葡萄糖（C6）和木糖（C5），理论产率：</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>Y</mi><mrow><mi>E</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>46</mn></mrow><mn>180</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.51</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Y_{EtOH/glucose} = \\frac{2 \\times 46}{180} = 0.51\\ g/g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">Y</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">tO</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cose</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0074em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">180</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">46</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.51</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span></div><ol start=\"4\">\n<li><strong>同步糖化发酵（SSF）与联合生物加工（CBP）</strong>：将酶解与发酵合并为一步，降低产物对酶的反馈抑制</li>\n</ol>\n<p>全球产能现状：美国POET-DSM项目、巴西Raízen工厂年产能已达千万加仑级，但经济性仍依赖碳信用与政策补贴。</p>\n<h3 id=\"生物柴油与高级生物燃料\">生物柴油与高级生物燃料</h3><p><strong>脂肪酸甲酯（FAME）生物柴油</strong>：传统的油脂转酯化路线正被微生物油脂路线补充——</p>\n<p>产油酵母（<em>Yarrowia lipolytica</em>）在氮源限制条件下将碳源转化为胞内脂肪酸：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>脂肪酸得率</mtext><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>256</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>180</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1.9</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{脂肪酸得率}_{theoretical} = \\frac{8 \\times 256}{6 \\times 180} = 1.9\\ g/g_{glucose}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">脂肪酸得率</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">eor</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0908em;vertical-align:-0.7693em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">256</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7693em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.9</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0359em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">cose</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>实际得率受辅因子（NADPH）供给限制，典型值为0.2-0.3 g/g。</p>\n<p><strong>高级生物燃料</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>异丁醇：能量密度接近汽油，可混入现有基础设施（Gevo公司商业化）</li>\n<li>法尼烯（C15萜类）：Amyris生产，经加氢为航空煤油替代品</li>\n<li>脂肪醇/烷烃：直接替代柴油组分</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"生物基大宗化学品\">生物基大宗化学品</h3><p>石化平台化学品的生物替代路线已有多个商业化案例：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>化学品</th>\n<th>年产量(万吨)</th>\n<th>微生物平台</th>\n<th>关键技术突破</th>\n<th>代表企业</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1,3-丙二醇</td>\n<td>&gt;20</td>\n<td>工程化<em>E. coli</em></td>\n<td>甘油→1,3-PDO异源通路</td>\n<td>杜邦-Tate&amp;Lyle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丁二酸</td>\n<td>~5</td>\n<td><em>E. coli</em> / <em>A. succinogenes</em></td>\n<td>还原TCA循环强化</td>\n<td>BioAmber/Succinity</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>乳酸</td>\n<td>&gt;100</td>\n<td><em>Lactobacillus</em> / 工程<em>E. coli</em></td>\n<td>光学纯度&gt;99.5%</td>\n<td>NatureWorks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>丙烯酸前体（3-HP）</td>\n<td>中试</td>\n<td><em>E. coli</em></td>\n<td>丙二酰CoA还原通路</td>\n<td>Cargill</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>己二酸</td>\n<td>中试</td>\n<td><em>E. coli</em></td>\n<td>反Diels-Alder酶路线</td>\n<td>多学术团队</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>市场竞争力公式：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>竞争力</mtext><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mfrac><mtext>石油价格</mtext><mtext>生物制造成本</mtext></mfrac><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow><mo>×</mo><mtext>碳税因子</mtext><mo>×</mo><mtext>功能性溢价</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{竞争力} = f\\left(\\frac{\\text{石油价格}}{\\text{生物制造成本}}\\right) \\times \\text{碳税因子} \\times \\text{功能性溢价}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">竞争力</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.4em;vertical-align:-0.95em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">生物制造成本</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">石油价格</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\"><span class=\"delimsizing size3\">)</span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">碳税因子</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">功能性溢价</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"碳一化合物生物转化\">碳一化合物生物转化</h3><p>利用甲醇、甲烷或合成气（CO/H₂）作为非粮碳源：</p>\n<p><strong>甲醇生物转化</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>天然甲基营养菌（<em>Methylobacterium</em>、<em>Pichia pastoris</em>）可直接利用甲醇</li>\n<li>工程化大肠杆菌引入甲醇同化途径（RuMP循环）——2025年首次实现甲醇为唯一碳源的生长</li>\n<li>绿色甲醇（Green Methanol）来源于CO₂加氢，形成&quot;CO₂→甲醇→化学品&quot;的负碳循环</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>合成气发酵</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><em>Clostridium autoethanogenum</em>利用CO/H₂生产乙醇——LanzaTech已实现年产数万吨规模</li>\n<li>Wood-Ljungdahl途径：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>C</mi><mi>O</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>O</mi><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>5</mn></msub><mi>O</mi><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>C</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6CO + 3H_2O \\rightarrow C_2H_5OH + 4CO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">5</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>与钢铁厂尾气、垃圾气化耦合，实现废碳资源化</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"co-生物固定与利用\">CO₂生物固定与利用</h3><p><strong>自养微生物固碳</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>蓝细菌/微藻光合固碳：理论效率~10%光能转化（实际1-3%）</li>\n<li>化能自养菌（氢氧化细菌<em>Cupriavidus necator</em>）：利用H₂为电子供体固定CO₂合成PHB</li>\n<li>电-生物耦合（Microbial Electrosynthesis）：电极直接供给电子驱动CO₂还原</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>人工碳固定途径</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CETCH循环（2016年Erb团队设计）：17酶体外固碳，效率超Calvin循环</li>\n<li>天津工业生物所&quot;ASAP&quot;途径（2022）：电能驱动的CO₂→淀粉人工合成路线</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;CO₂&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;光合/电能&quot;| B[&quot;C1(甲酸/甲醇)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|&quot;生物转化&quot;| C[&quot;C2-C4平台化学品&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;聚合物/燃料/材料&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;人工固碳途径&quot;| C\">graph TD\n    A[\"CO₂\"] --&gt;|\"光合/电能\"| B[\"C1(甲酸/甲醇)\"]\n    B --&gt;|\"生物转化\"| C[\"C2-C4平台化学品\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"聚合物/燃料/材料\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"人工固碳途径\"| C</pre><h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><p>2026年生物燃料与化学品领域关键动态：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>LanzaTech与印度塔塔钢铁合作的50万吨/年合成气乙醇工厂投产，成为全球最大气体发酵设施</li>\n<li>欧盟碳边境调节机制（CBAM）全面实施，使生物基化学品相比石化路线获得约€80/吨CO₂的成本优势</li>\n<li>天津大学团队实现大肠杆菌以CO₂为唯一碳源生长（电驱动），生长速率达<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.05</mn><mtext> </mtext><msup><mi>h</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu = 0.05\\ h^{-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.05</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>Solugen（美国）使用酶催化过氧化氢路线生产葡萄糖酸，年产10万吨级已盈利——验证了&quot;酶+电&quot;混合路线的商业可行性</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>纤维素乙醇的经济性受哪三个因素影响最大？为什么联合生物加工（CBP）被认为是&quot;终极方案&quot;？</li>\n<li>产油酵母的脂肪酸理论得率为1.9 g/g glucose，但实际仅0.2-0.3 g/g。分析导致巨大差距的主要原因（至少3个）。</li>\n<li>比较合成气发酵（LanzaTech路线）与传统化学催化（Fischer-Tropsch）的优劣势。在什么条件下生物路线更有竞争力？</li>\n<li>碳税设为€80/吨CO₂时，估算一个年产5万吨丁二酸的生物工厂相比石化路线每年可获得多少碳信用收益（丁二酸石化路线碳排约3 tCO₂/t产品，生物路线净固碳约0.5 tCO₂/t产品）。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>生物燃料与化学品是生物制造规模最大的应用领域。纤维素乙醇与产油微生物为液体燃料提供了可再生替代方案；1,3-丙二醇、丁二酸、乳酸等平台化学品已实现商业化生产。碳一化合物利用（甲醇、合成气、CO₂）代表了&quot;非粮碳源&quot;的未来方向，而碳税/碳交易政策正在根本性地改变生物路线与石化路线的经济竞争格局。生物制造不仅是技术问题，更是与全球能源转型和碳中和目标紧密交织的系统工程。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"生物燃料与化学品","id":"生物燃料与化学品"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"纤维素乙醇","id":"纤维素乙醇"},{"level":3,"text":"生物柴油与高级生物燃料","id":"生物柴油与高级生物燃料"},{"level":3,"text":"生物基大宗化学品","id":"生物基大宗化学品"},{"level":3,"text":"碳一化合物生物转化","id":"碳一化合物生物转化"},{"level":3,"text":"CO₂生物固定与利用","id":"co-生物固定与利用"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"智能生物过程控制","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/bioprocess-equipment/intelligent-bioprocess-control"},"next":{"title":"生物材料与生物塑料","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/interdisciplinary/biomanufacturing/industrial-applications/biomaterials-bioplastics"}}